WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.500
On your team's page, tap Add to my calendar.

2
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:19.200
Your iPhone asks once: tap Subscribe, then Add.

3
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:25.800
Every game lands in your calendar and stays current.

4
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.600
On iPhone, each game starts with no alert.

5
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:45.800
Turn it on once: Settings › Apps › Calendar › Default Alert Times.

6
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.000
Events: 1 hour before. It covers every timed event, games included.

7
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.900
Now every game nudges you an hour before it starts.
